              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Faythe"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The almond extract is just too much for this recipe. There's so much going on in the cookie that don't really mesh well together. Perhaps substituting vanilla extract for the almond. Not a fan of the rye flour. Whole wheat flour substituted well.",
            "datePublished": "2011-05-22T19:24:52.693Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
